{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 132,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah, remember for David\nAll his affliction;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How he sware unto Jehovah,\nAnd vowed unto the Mighty One of Jacob:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely I will not come into the tabernacle of my house,\nNor go up into my bed;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will not give sleep to mine eyes,\nOr slumber to mine eyelids;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Until I find out a place for Jehovah,A tabernacle for the Mighty One of Jacob.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lo, we heard of it in Ephrathah:\nWe found it in the field of the wood.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "We will go into his tabernacles;\nWe will worship at his footstool.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Arise, O Jehovah, into thy resting-place;\nThou, and the ark of thy strength.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let thy priests be clothed with righteousness;\nAnd let thy saints shout for joy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thy servant David’s sake\nTurn not away the face of thine anointed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah hath sworn unto David in truth;\nHe will not turn from it:\nOf the fruit of thy body will I set upon thy throne.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thy children will keep my covenant\nAnd my testimony that I shall teach them,\nTheir children also shall sit upon thy throne for evermore.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For Jehovah hath chosen Zion;\nHe hath desired it for his habitation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This is my resting-place for ever:\nHere will I dwell; for I have desired it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will abundantly bless her provision:\nI will satisfy her poor with bread.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Her priests also will I clothe with salvation;\nAnd her saints shall shout aloud for joy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There will I make the horn of David to bud:\nI have ordained a lamp for mine anointed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.132.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His enemies will I clothe with shame;\nBut upon himself shall his crown flourish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Prayer for Jehovah’s blessing upon the sanctuary.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "A Song of Ascents.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
